{"hw":"Ἀθήναιον","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">Ἀθήναιον</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">Ἀθήν-αιον</span>, <span class=\"lex-gram\">τό</span>, (<span class=\"lex-etym gk\">Ἀθηνᾶ</span>) <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">the temple of Athena</b>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">5.95</span> </span>, etc. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"2\"><span class=\"lex-n\">II</span> lecture-hall at Rome, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">D.C.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">73.17</span> </span>. <span class=\"gk\">-αῖος, <span class=\"lex-itype gk\">α</span>, <span class=\"lex-itype gk\">ον</span> </span>, <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Athenian</cite>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Il.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">2.551</span> </span>, etc. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"2\"><span class=\"lex-n\">II</span> <span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Dor.</span> </span> <span class=\"lex-orth gk\">Ἀθαναῖος</span>, sc. <span class=\"gk\">μήν</span>, month in Locris, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">IG</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">9(1).385</span> </span>.</div></div>"}